        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Altamont%2C_Kansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The first settlers were the Huston family, who settled about a mile east of that lone tree.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
