      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Altamont%2C_Kansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Altamont was officially incorporated in 1884, solidifying its status as a growing community.",
